WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.780
- I thought we should
end the interview right.

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:03.970
We only have a few minutes left,

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.180
so I'm gonna bring out some wine, okay?

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.237
- All right, yeah.

00:00:07.237 --> 00:00:09.320
(wooing)

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.059
- I'm gonna ask y'all a bunch
of rapid-fire questions.

00:00:13.059 --> 00:00:14.487
- Wow, oh this is--
- Thank you.

00:00:14.487 --> 00:00:16.549
- Cheers.
- Yeah, I know.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:18.011
We've got a good one.

00:00:18.011 --> 00:00:19.103
(cheering)

00:00:19.103 --> 00:00:21.347
Tell 'em about that,
this is your wine, right?

00:00:21.347 --> 00:00:22.180
- Yeah.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.082
- This is your wine.

00:00:23.082 --> 00:00:23.915
- [Kimberly] It's ours.

00:00:23.915 --> 00:00:24.748
- So, it's that, by Little
Big Town, Four Cellars.

00:00:24.748 --> 00:00:25.581
- It's our wine.

00:00:25.581 --> 00:00:26.414
- We also sell it in--

00:00:26.414 --> 00:00:27.994
- Get it, in four, get it?

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.034
(laughing)

00:00:29.034 --> 00:00:30.060
- See what we did there?

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.110
- Okay, this is a little thing

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.577
we like to call, "The Wine Down."

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:38.130
Okay, Philip, I'm gonna start with you,

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:40.370
who's most likely to pull a prank?

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.310
- Jimi.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.143
- Jimi.
- Jimi.

00:00:42.143 --> 00:00:43.560
- Why, what kind of pranks?

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:45.004
- He's always prankin'--

00:00:45.004 --> 00:00:46.070
- But, you got him.

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:48.530
- Well, we all got him
good one time because

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.688
Karen, it was when Karen
was pregnant with their son.

00:00:51.688 --> 00:00:52.710
- Real pregnant.
- Yeah.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:54.343
- We were in the studio, and Jimi had a--

00:00:54.343 --> 00:00:56.620
- I had nothing left to
give this baby, I was.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:57.453
- [Kelly] I get it.

00:00:57.453 --> 00:00:58.286
- She gave it all.
- Yep.

00:00:58.286 --> 00:01:00.097
- So I said, "C'mon girls, we can pretend,

00:01:00.097 --> 00:01:02.910
"And pretend like your
water broke," so we.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:03.743
- Oh my God, that's mean.

00:01:03.743 --> 00:01:06.355
- Jimi was in the bathroom.
- That is terrible, right?

00:01:06.355 --> 00:01:07.497
- Jimi was--
- That's not a joke!

00:01:07.497 --> 00:01:08.880
- And we were in the studio together,

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.863
and we took a water bottle
and poured some on the floor,

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:15.030
and when he came around from the bathroom,

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:16.280
we were like, Jimi--

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.420
- She was standing there and there

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:20.800
was water all over the floor,
I'm like, "What the freak?"

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:21.950
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:22.783
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:25.484
- And then they all got to
watch you, that's so mean.

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:26.730
- I squealed so loud.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.040
- He's hard to get, so.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.800
- I love it, those are the best ones,

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.060
when you get them, my husband
and I do the same thing.

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:32.893
- [Philip] Yeah.

00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:34.970
- Kimberly, who's the
messiest on the tour bus?

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:37.232
- Well, Philip, 'cause he spills a lot.

00:01:37.232 --> 00:01:38.111
(laughing)

00:01:38.111 --> 00:01:39.280
We call him Spillip.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:40.661
- Probably 'cause he's drinking.

00:01:40.661 --> 00:01:42.400
(laughing)

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.620
Karen, who's the biggest crier?

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:45.491
- Philip.

00:01:45.491 --> 00:01:47.741
(laughing)

00:01:49.587 --> 00:01:52.322
- He'd cry, yeah, he cries literally--

00:01:52.322 --> 00:01:53.155
- Surely.

00:01:53.155 --> 00:01:54.256
- Philip, I feel like you're getting

00:01:54.256 --> 00:01:55.089
picked on a little here, man--

00:01:55.089 --> 00:01:55.970
- [Karen] No.

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:56.803
- No, I'm--

00:01:56.803 --> 00:01:57.907
- He's very emotional.
- I'm a close second.

00:01:57.907 --> 00:01:58.740
- [Kelly] I'm a middler.

00:01:58.740 --> 00:01:59.573
- Jimi's a close second.

00:01:59.573 --> 00:02:00.446
- I love that it's not the women.

00:02:00.446 --> 00:02:01.304
- [Karen] I know.

00:02:01.304 --> 00:02:02.604
- [Kelly] It's so amazing.

